course-data.js

# The commercial module. Proprietary, and this repository is GPL-3.0 — so it is
# ignored here rather than merely untracked, because the cost of one absent-minded
# `git add -A` is publishing code that was never meant to be distributed.
#
# It becomes a submodule rather than a tracked directory, and `git submodule add`
# refuses an ignored path, so the handover in docs/open-core.md passes --force.
# The gitlink and .gitmodules are what get committed; the contents never do.
/pro/